So from what I can see, dev isn't currently broken for this model — `demo.duckdb` connects and `fct_activity_daily` builds and passes all tests against it. If you're hitting a different local-db error, it might be environment-specific (e.g. a stale lock, a different `DEMO_DB` path, or something not reproduced here) — happy to dig into that instead, but prod runs will need to come from you directly.
